---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Consulting — Sustainabox">

	<div class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Expert Consulting</h1>
			<p>Design review, planning, risk mitigation, and expert guidance for your container home or alternative housing project.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="container content-section">
		<h2>What We Offer</h2>

		<div class="offerings">
			<div class="offering">
				<h3>Design Review & Feasibility</h3>
				<p><strong>$500–2,000</strong></p>
				<p>Send us your plans, photos, or ideas. We review for:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Structural feasibility</li>
					<li>Code compliance risks</li>
					<li>Cost optimization opportunities</li>
					<li>Timeline risks</li>
					<li>Supply chain and trade coordination</li>
				</ul>
				<p><strong>Deliverable:</strong> Written report with findings and recommendations (3–5 pages).</p>
			</div>

			<div class="offering">
				<h3>Full Planning Package</h3>
				<p><strong>$3,000–10,000</strong></p>
				<p>End-to-end planning for your project:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Design optimization (if needed)</li>
					<li>Detailed cost breakdown (materials, labor, contingency)</li>
					<li>Timeline with milestones and dependencies</li>
					<li>Risk register (what could go wrong, how to mitigate)</li>
					<li>Permitting and code compliance roadmap</li>
					<li>Vendor and trade coordination plan</li>
				</ul>
				<p><strong>Deliverable:</strong> 20–30 page planning document + 2 follow-up calls.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="offering">
				<h3>Fractional Architect / Project Manager</h3>
				<p><strong>$150–250/hour</strong></p>
				<p>Ongoing support during your build:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Design decisions and problem-solving</li>
					<li>Code compliance questions</li>
					<li>Cost overrun analysis and mitigation</li>
					<li>Timeline adjustments</li>
					<li>Trade coordination and conflict resolution</li>
				</ul>
				<p><strong>Deliverable:</strong> Hourly or monthly retainer. You call when you need guidance.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Why Work With Us</h2>
		<div class="why-list">
			<div class="why-item">
				<h4>Real Experience</h4>
				<p>We've designed and built a full container home. We know costs, timelines, mistakes, and trade-offs firsthand.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-item">
				<h4>Risk Thinking</h4>
				<p>15+ years of enterprise risk and resilience expertise. We don't just answer questions—we identify risks others miss.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-item">
				<h4>Vendor Network</h4>
				<p>We know contractors, material suppliers, permitting officials, and inspectors. We can help you avoid bad decisions.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-item">
				<h4>Practical, Not Theoretical</h4>
				<p>Advice grounded in actual constraints: budgets, timelines, local codes, trade availability. No fluff.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">How It Works</h2>
		<ol class="process-list">
			<li><strong>Schedule a free 30-minute call.</strong> Tell us about your project, goals, and timeline.</li>
			<li><strong>We propose a scope and price.</strong> Pick the service that fits.</li>
			<li><strong>You get actionable advice.</strong> Written report, calls, or ongoing support depending on what you chose.</li>
			<li><strong>You execute with clarity.</strong> You have a roadmap. We're available for follow-up questions.</li>
		</ol>

		<div class="cta-box">
			<h3>Ready to Get Started?</h3>
			<p>Schedule a free consultation call. No obligation.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a Call</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.content-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.offerings {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.offering {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.offering h3 {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.offering p:first-of-type {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.offering ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	.offering li {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.offering li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.why-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.why-item {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.why-item h4 {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.process-list {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		line-height: 2;
	}

	.process-list li {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.cta-box {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.cta-box h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.cta-box p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
</style>
